{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_098_title", "source_sha256": "23068b8c3c3874e65548c226571bd350eb998854f225ce899bce2bac28854373", "ja": "虹の辿り着く先", "zh": "彩虹到达的终点", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_098_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d8f8ad45437a7832faaa5cf494711f363b0aba3ba22482625f76e102ff62ab6e", "ja": "静香と翼のケンカを見た環は、雨模様の空と\n呼応するように泣き出してしまう。幼い頃の\n記憶から、友達がとても大切な環。仲直りの\n後、環達は百合子のアイディアで、雨上がり\nの空に笑顔の虹を作る。", "zh": "看到静香和翼吵架的环，仿佛在呼应阴雨绵绵的天空般哭了起来。因小时候的记忆，朋友对环而言非常重要。和好之后，环等人在百合子的提议下，于雨后的天空中架起了一道笑容的彩虹。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_098_1000_p", "source_sha256": "23d4fa53934330734ae44a841eb356938a36e94a7a5a5bdb3840ca18b0d6443c", "ja": "（環の新曲お披露目公演が終わった。\n拍手が鳴り止まない……）", "zh": "（环的新歌首演结束了。\n掌声经久不息……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_098_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "4c00cc931a92fc0cc653d1afd5760cbf495e3ca8ad400501bed3356826fb28f8", "ja": "おやぶん、ステージ終わったよー！\nねえねえ、どうだった？", "zh": "老大，舞台结束啦——！\n呐呐，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_098_1002_p", "source_sha256": "2dabcfb4374add7a3584c61ce1b498fdb8ee271adcc7218e5eec80ccf20530a4", "ja": "お疲れさま、環！\n最後まで頑張ったな、えらいぞ！", "zh": "辛苦了，环！\n一直努力到最后，真棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_098_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "dfb94757b4634de497093a39ac8edd1a3c793d84b6464b246574f60758c51ea9", "ja": "うん！　たまき、\nまだまだ元気いっぱいだぞ～♪", "zh": "嗯！小环还精神满满呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_098_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "eb144e3b32b62568107e7cd8af1c17bd45f52b347c4ee36b87a3cba3c8448c3a", "ja": "あ、アンコールまでは、なんとか\nこなせましたけど……私もう、限界かも……。", "zh": "啊，安可总算是勉强完成了……我已经，快到极限了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_098_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "0bdaa6fc7e12d94158643918d210f2fe2f47e668bdd6483724b043ad9831f801", "ja": "こ、子どもって体力があるって\n聞くけど……想像以上ね……。", "zh": "听、听说小孩子的体力都很好……没想到比想象中还厉害……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_098_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0021bce8002c8776766c3196dc99852064b715f2e2ce3e3a28d9aec21fe7590b", "ja": "でもお客さんたち、すっごく楽しそうだったよ！\nよかったね、環♪", "zh": "不过观众们看起来都特别开心呢！\n太好了，环！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_098_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "3e038d55bf33da87bf7bae027e510f90017a677d91db31a78351add425aee936", "ja": "うん！　お客さんがみんなニコニコしてて、\nたまき、すっごくうれしかった！", "zh": "嗯！客人们全都笑眯眯的，环真的特别开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_098_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "4c444dc5327e1fe4acdb17d17db77cf0fc3f307bfdf2ec9bfc4894facd3e187c", "ja": "あと、おやぶんの言ったとおりだった！", "zh": "还有，正如老大说的那样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_098_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "94bee0350ce3bc2d554c79776f87abc60fa96d6d63201f13b52603111cacf932", "ja": "ケンカしても、絶対に仲直りできるって！\n友達って、すごいぞ～！", "zh": "就算吵架了，也绝对能和好！\n朋友真厉害呀～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_098_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "9e1c9c38afaada5a0739280a1fd478a0ad7ceebcd43aab27ec06e56a084d1d77", "ja": "それじゃあ、今日は……公演成功と、\n仲直りを祝って打ち上げだー！　派手にやっちゃおう！", "zh": "那今天就……为公演成功和重归于好开庆功宴吧——！好好热闹一场！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
